WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:04.330
Generate a cover letter written for that job. Not a template.

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:07.769
Open a saved job. Tap generate.

00:00:08.069 --> 00:00:09.500
It reads the posting.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.646
Then researches the company itself.

00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:16.984
The letter comes back written for that role, at that company.

00:00:17.284 --> 00:00:21.997
Pick your region's format. Download as PDF or Word.

00:00:22.297 --> 00:00:27.395
And did you know it can fill the application form for you? That is next.

